| `Color.BackgroundSolid` | `(0.02, 0.02, 0.05, 1.0)` | Title (fully opaque variant) |
| `Color.Cyan` | `(0.36, 1.0, 0.86, 1.0)` | Title, Finale title, Progress completed, OptionButton pressed |
| `Color.CyanDim` | `(0.36, 1.0, 0.86, 0.8)` | Title prompt, Finale trait labels |
| `Color.CyanFaint` | `(0.36, 1.0, 0.86, 0.9)` | Finale trait labels |
| `Color.Gold` | `(1.0, 0.8, 0.2, 1.0)` | Progress current indicator |
| `Color.TextPrimary` | `(0.9, 0.9, 0.9, 1.0)` | OptionButton text, Finale trait values |
| `Color.TextSecondary` | `(0.7, 0.7, 0.8, 1.0)` | Finale subtitle |
| `Color.TextDim` | `(0.5, 0.5, 0.6, 1.0)` | Title subtitle, Connecting, Question progress |
| `Color.TextMuted` | `(0.4, 0.4, 0.5, 1.0)` | Finale dim, checksum |
| `Color.Insight` | `(0.7, 0.8, 0.7, 1.0)` | Finale insights |
| `Color.IncompleteGray` | `(0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.5)` | Progress incomplete |
| `Color.ButtonNormal` | `(0.1, 0.1, 0.15, 1.0)` | OptionButton normal |
